# A Tour level's score tiers are goals too (pro, sick). Lowered here to 1,000 and 2,400 so the Big 3
# combo (Kickflip + BIG 3 GAP + Manual + Heelflip, 2,464) reaches both when it lands, with the
# level's own Big 3 Combo goal on the same tick; the clock cut to 10 s, levelOver lists all three.
park soma
cmd 0 setData tour.levels.0.tiers.pro 1000
cmd 0 setData tour.levels.0.tiers.sick 2400
cmd 0 setData tour.seconds 10
cmd 0 run level soma
cmd 5 teleport big3
hold up 5..105
hold ollie 171..201
tap flip+left 207
tap up 325
tap down 330
hold ollie 405..425
tap flip+right 431
bot balance
run 1300
expect event comboLanded{name=Kickflip + BIG 3 GAP + Manual + Heelflip,points=2464} within 530..534
expect event levelGoal{level=soma,id=pro,name=Pro Score} within 530..534
expect event levelGoal{level=soma,id=sick,name=Sick Score} within 530..534
expect event levelGoal{level=soma,id=big3combo,name=Big 3 Combo} within 530..534
expect event levelGoal count == 3
expect event levelOver{level=soma,score=2464,tape=false} within 1199..1210
expect session.levelGoals.length == 3 at end
expect no event bail
